Title Advice regarding the HRT in a 48-year-old woman with the history of hysterectomy
Category Obstetrics / Gynecology > Gynecology > Gynecological hormonal disorders
CO Flag as important Notes
A 48-year-old woman with a history of hysterectomy comes to discuss hormone replacement
