deficiency of which one of the following vitamins?','{"A":"A. Vitamin A.","B":"B. Vitamin B complex.","C":"C. Vitamin C.","D":"D. Vitamin D","E":"OE. Vitamin K."}','E','Breast milk lacks or has insufficient vitamin K, but as this vitamin is given
