infections in children?','{"A":"A. Proteus mirabilis.","B":"OB. E.coli.","C":"C. Staphycoccis aureus.","D":"D. Enterobacter.","E":"E. Pseudomonas."}','B','In children, between 75% and 90% of urinary tract infections are caused by
