Bone age assessment (option B) is considered in constitutional growth delay (CGD) alongside exclusion of other
causes of delayed puberty/growth to confirm the diagnosis or where the child is small for age. This child has
normal weight and height for age.

Ultrasound of the pelvis (option A) is the study of choice for girls whose periods are overdue despite development
of other secondary sexual characteristics, normal body measures, and absence of features suggesting
chromosomal abnormalities such as Turner syndrome.

NOTE- puberty starts with thelarche. A Tanner II breast before the age of 13 years suggests estrogen exposure
and commencement of puberty in girls. This is equivalent to testicular enlargement in boys. A Tanner II or less after
13 years is abnormal and indicated absence of breast development.',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2025','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Pediatric amedex 2025.pdf","supporting_pages":[61],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-9d5cc3a02b94","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"e1296c635c0bbcc41248","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Pediatric amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Pediatric amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":61,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"3eabacab51dde87b2f56","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (1).pdf","source_page":176,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"3d3c7f6314839b784e40","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (1).pdf","source_page":177,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence